13
01:38:09,000 --> 01:38:15,000
Armageddon is a 1998 American science fiction disaster film directed
by Michael Bay and  co-produced by Jerry Bruckheimer.

14
01:45:42,000 --> 01:45:48,000
The film follows a group of blue-collar deep-core drillers sent by NASA to destroy a
gigantic asteroid, which is the size of Texas, on a collision course with Earth.

15
01:53:15,000 --> 01:53:21,000
It stars an ensemble cast including Bruce Willis with Billy Bob Thornton, Liv Tyler, Ben Affleck, Will
Patton, Peter Stormare, Keith David, Owen Wilson, William Fichtner and Steve Buscemi.

16
02:00:48,000 --> 02:00:54,000
The film released on July 1, 1998 by Buena Vista Pictures
through its Touchstone Pictures label.

17
02:08:21,000 --> 02:08:27,000
Despite receiving mixed reviews from critics, Armageddon was a commercial success, grossing $553.7 million worldwide against a $140 million
budget, becoming the highest-grossing film of 1998, and the highest-grossing film to be released by Touchstone Pictures.

18
02:15:54,000 --> 02:16:00,000
The film explores themes of daughter, race against time,
space marine, moon, washington dc, usa.

